{"author": "edwong57", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete:\nGO:0070085 glycosylation \nGO:0036065 fucosylation \nGO:0036071 N-glycan fucosylation \nGO:0030259 lipid glycosylation \nGO:0042125 protein galactosylation\n\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/30371\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1IjyrU3Yis15sYrtwAHtpBpIG-hVQ-qmn93mo9kEJtRM/edit?usp=sharing\n\nImpacted groups: \n\nAspGD 2\nBHF-UCL 3 - done\nComplexPortal 9\nFlyBase 6\nGeneDB 1\nGOC 1\nMGI 8\n~TAIR 2~\nUniProt 61\nZFIN 3\n\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \nUniRule 3\nInterPro2GO 3\n\nterm | file | line\n-- | -- | --\n GO:0030259 | interpro2go | InterPro:IPR004276 Glycosyltransferase family 28, N-terminal domain > GO:lipid glycosylation ; GO:0030259\nGO:0030259 | interpro2go | InterPro:IPR011143 Ganglioside GM2 synthase > GO:lipid glycosylation ; GO:0030259\nGO:0030259 | unirule2go | UniRule:UR000036431 > GO:lipid glycosylation ; GO:0030259\nGO:0030259 | unirule2go | UniRule:UR000359778 > GO:lipid glycosylation ; GO:0030259\nGO:0030259 | hamap2go | HAMAP:MF_00033 > GO:lipid glycosylation ; GO:0030259\nGO:0036065 | interpro2go | InterPro:IPR009993 TDP-N-acetylfucosamine:lipid II N-acetylfucosaminyltransferase > GO:fucosylation ; GO:0036065\nGO:0036065 | unirule2go | UniRule:UR000617775 > GO:fucosylation ; GO:0036065\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-06-06T20:23:46Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to GO:0070085 glycosylation GO:0036065 fucosylation GO:0036071 N-glycan fucosylation GO:0030259 lipid glycosylation ,GO:0042125 protein galactosylation", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T09:39:58Z"}
